{"4513000": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Mexican Train", "steam_appid": 4513000, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4513000/extras/d25cb734a543a1dfe6b82a89ee6bd87c.poster.avif?t=1786789708\" width=1170 height=524 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4513000/extras/d25cb734a543a1dfe6b82a89ee6bd87c.webm?t=1786789708\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4513000/extras/d25cb734a543a1dfe6b82a89ee6bd87c.mp4?t=1786789708\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online Multiplayer and Solo Play</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supports up to 7 players per online multiplayer session or play solo with up to 6 CPU players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable House Rules</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play 1-13 Rounds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick Starting Domino</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Score Type: Points or Round Wins</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn On /Off Timer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn On /Off Dreaded Double</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn On/Off Draw and Play</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your Monkey and Train</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4513000/extras/44b6872e7e0d38dc9af89b4bce5f40b9.poster.avif?t=1786789708\" width=1170 height=524 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4513000/extras/44b6872e7e0d38dc9af89b4bce5f40b9.webm?t=1786789708\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4513000/extras/44b6872e7e0d38dc9af89b4bce5f40b9.mp4?t=1786789708\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick between 4 Different Environments</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play at Cozy Backyard, Little Italy, Old Train Town, or Beach Bash</p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4513000/extras/50a9cde073a4b31966a454ed7e249301.poster.avif?t=1786789708\" width=1170 height=524 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4513000/extras/50a9cde073a4b31966a454ed7e249301.webm?t=1786789708\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4513000/extras/50a9cde073a4b31966a454ed7e249301.mp4?t=1786789708\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play On The Mexican Train, Your Train, or Open Trains</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Match your domino with any available train. Place all of your dominoes before your opponents to claim the Victory!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4513000/extras/38da8fd721ce8c9d7329692f45be7541.poster.avif?t=1786789708\" width=1170 height=524 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4513000/extras/38da8fd721ce8c9d7329692f45be7541.webm?t=1786789708\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4513000/extras/38da8fd721ce8c9d7329692f45be7541.mp4?t=1786789708\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get Off My Train!!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Close Your Train To Block the Competition! When you play on your own train, it closes. Your train only opens if you cannot play a domino.  Although the Mexican Train stays open for everyone.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4513000/extras/11f253296844b04ce5995080804fd4f3.poster.avif?t=1786789708\" width=1170 height=524 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4513000/extras/11f253296844b04ce5995080804fd4f3.webm?t=1786789708\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4513000/extras/11f253296844b04ce5995080804fd4f3.mp4?t=1786789708\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fire, &amp; Darkness, &amp; Dreaded Double Domino, oh my!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If anyone plays a domino with the same value on both sides, then someone has to find a matching domino end, or risk continuously drawing dominoes from the boneyard!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4513000/extras/ab87187c6dabcea334b50c6987c722a8.poster.avif?t=1786789708\" width=1170 height=524 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4513000/extras/ab87187c6dabcea334b50c6987c722a8.webm?t=1786789708\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4513000/extras/ab87187c6dabcea334b50c6987c722a8.mp4?t=1786789708\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize Your Monkey</p>